    <DIV STYLE="break-before: page; margin-top: 6pt; margin-bottom: 12pt"><P STYLE="margin: 0pt">&nbsp;</P></DIV>
    <!-- Field: /Page -->

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B>HUB CYBER SECURITY LTD.&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"></P>

<!-- Field: Rule-Page --><DIV STYLE="margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; width: 100%"><DIV STYLE="font-size: 1pt; border-top: Black 1.5pt solid">&nbsp;</DIV></DIV><!-- Field: /Rule-Page -->

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B>Notice of Annual General Meeting of Shareholders</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"></P>

<!-- Field: Rule-Page --><DIV STYLE="margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; width: 100%"><DIV STYLE="font-size: 1pt; border-top: Black 1.5pt solid">&nbsp;</DIV></DIV><!-- Field: /Rule-Page -->

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">NOTICE IS HEREBY GIVEN that
the 2025 Annual General Meeting (the &ldquo;<B>Annual Meeting</B>&rdquo;) of shareholders of HUB Cyber Security Ltd. (&ldquo;<B>HUB</B>&rdquo;
or the &ldquo;<B>Company</B>&rdquo;) will be held on December 16, 2025, at 10:00 a.m., Israel time, at our offices at 2 Kaplan Street,
Tel Aviv 6473403, Israel.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">The Annual Meeting is being
called for the following purposes:</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLSPACING="0" CELLPADDING="0" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%">
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="width: 48px">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="width: 24px"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">1.</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">To re-elect each of Renah Persofsky and Shlomo Bibas as a Class III Director of the Board of Directors of the Company (the &ldquo;<B>Board</B>&rdquo; or the &ldquo;<B>Board of Directors</B>&rdquo;), to serve until the 2028 annual general meeting of shareholders and until her or his respective successor has been duly elected and qualified.</FONT></TD></TR>
  </TABLE>
<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.75in">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLSPACING="0" CELLPADDING="0" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%">
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="width: 48px">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="width: 24px"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">2.</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">To elect Vineet Malhotra as a Class II Director of the Board, to serve until the 2027 annual general meeting of shareholders and until his successor has been duly elected and qualified.</FONT></TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">3.</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">To approve the compensation payable to the Company&rsquo;s Chief Executive Officer.</FONT></TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">4.</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">To approve the equity compensation payable to the Company&rsquo;s non-executive directors.</FONT></TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">5.</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">To approve an increase in the Company&rsquo;s authorized share capital, from one hundred million (100,000,000) ordinary shares, no par value, to one billion (1,000,000,000) ordinary shares, no par value, and to amend the Company&rsquo;s Articles of Association and the Company&rsquo;s Memorandum of Association accordingly.</FONT></TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">6.</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">To approve settlements with the investors who had committed to invest in the Company&rsquo;s private placement of ordinary shares in February 2023.</FONT></TD></TR>
  </TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.75in">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLSPACING="0" CELLPADDING="0" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%">
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="width: 48px">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="width: 24px; font-size: 10pt"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">7.</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">To approve the reappointment of Kost Forer Gabbay &amp; Kasierer, a member of EY Global, as the Company&rsquo;s independent registered public accounting firm until the next annual meeting of shareholders, and to authorize the Board of Directors, to fix the remuneration of said accounting firm or to delegate such authority to the Audit Committee of the Board as contemplated by the Sarbanes-Oxley Act of 2002.</FONT></TD></TR>
  </TABLE>
<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">In addition to considering
and voting on the foregoing matters (the &ldquo;<B>Proposals</B>&rdquo;), members of the Company&rsquo;s management will be available
at the Annual Meeting to discuss the consolidated financial statements of the Company for the fiscal year ended December 31, 2024.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">The foregoing proposals are
described in detail in the enclosed proxy statement (the &ldquo;<B>Proxy Statement</B>&rdquo;), which we urge you to read in its entirety.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">Our Board of Directors unanimously
recommends that you vote &ldquo;FOR&rdquo; each of the above proposals.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">Only shareholders of record
at the close of business on November 14, 2025 (the &ldquo;<B>Record Date</B>&rdquo;) will be entitled to notice of, and to vote at, the
Annual Meeting, or any adjournment or postponement thereof.&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">The Proxy Statement, along
with a proxy card enabling shareholders to indicate their vote on each matter presented at the Annual Meeting, is included with this
Notice of Annual General Meeting of Shareholders (the &ldquo;<B>Notice</B>&rdquo;) and is being mailed on or about November 18, 2025,
to all shareholders entitled to vote at the Annual Meeting. Such proxy statement shall also be furnished to the U.S. Securities and Exchange
Commission (the &ldquo;<B>SEC</B>&rdquo;) under cover of a Form 6-K and will be available on the Company&rsquo;s website at https://hub-technologies.com/
and on the SEC&rsquo;s website at www.sec.gov. Signed proxy cards must be received by Broadridge Financial Solutions, Inc. at Vote Processing,
c/o Broadridge, 51 Mercedes Way, Edgewood, New York 11717, or at our registered office, no later than forty-eight (48) hours before the
time fixed for the Annual Meeting in order for the proxy to be qualified to participate in the Annual Meeting.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><B></B></P>

